WEBVTT

00:00:05.525 --> 00:00:06.818
[groans, stammers]

00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:16.995
Ha, ha, ha!

00:00:23.585 --> 00:00:24.586
Whoa.

00:00:26.588 --> 00:00:27.673
[gasps]

00:00:28.257 --> 00:00:30.759
-[groans]
-[shouts]

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.013
Oh. Right in the possum parts. [groans]
正中负鼠要害

00:00:35.639 --> 00:00:37.599
-[roars]
-[both gasp]

00:00:47.484 --> 00:00:49.027
[thudding]

00:00:58.203 --> 00:00:59.621
-Yeah!
-Ha, ha!

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:15.721
[panting]

00:01:17.139 --> 00:01:20.183
Face it, guys.
Crash and Eddie have gone bye-bye.
面对现实吧 伙伴们
克拉什和埃迪肯定已经翘辫子了

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:22.936
They totally disappeared without a trace!
他们完全消失得无影无踪

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.062
[sighs]

00:01:24.146 --> 00:01:25.397
I got footprints.
我找到脚印了

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:26.690
[groans]

00:01:26.773 --> 00:01:29.443
All that means is their feet
were around here.
那只能说明他们的脚丫在附近

00:01:30.819 --> 00:01:33.030
Thank goodness. We're back on their trail.
谢天谢地 终于找到他们的踪迹了

00:01:33.113 --> 00:01:35.282
It looks like their trail leads to a--
他们的踪迹似乎是通往…

00:01:35.949 --> 00:01:39.953
Oh, no! Those ding-dongs
went back to the Lost World!
不会吧 那两个傻瓜回失落的世界去了

00:01:40.037 --> 00:01:42.873
Oh. And I thought I made bad choices.
我还以为只有我会做傻事呢

00:01:58.055 --> 00:02:00.057
[raptors snarling]

00:02:01.892 --> 00:02:05.562
[gasps] We're in luck!
Orson's raptors got smaller.
我们交好运啦 奥森的猛龙变小了

00:02:05.646 --> 00:02:07.022
Ha! They're tiny.
一群小不点

00:02:07.105 --> 00:02:10.984
I say we crush them like ants,
then shoot hoops at the watering hole.
叫我说 我们就像碾蚂蚁一样碾碎他们
然后往饮水坑里扔东西玩

00:02:11.068 --> 00:02:13.779
Guys, they're not tiny.
They're just far away.
伙计们 他们没有变小 只是离得远而已

00:02:14.571 --> 00:02:17.783
Oh. Well, in that case,
we're in huge trouble.
那我们的麻烦就大了

00:02:22.246 --> 00:02:23.288
Remember.
别忘了

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.004
[Zee] It's time to get…
是时候…

00:02:32.005 --> 00:02:33.298
Buck wild!
大显神威啦

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.556
The entrance is blocked.
Do you think they got through?
入口堵住了 你觉得他们进去了吗

00:02:40.639 --> 00:02:42.599
Only one way to find out.
只有一个办法能知道

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:46.103
[grunting]

00:02:46.186 --> 00:02:47.437
[spits]

00:02:49.356 --> 00:02:50.357
[groans]

00:02:51.149 --> 00:02:52.401
[grunting]

00:02:52.484 --> 00:02:54.570
Come on.
用力啊

00:03:05.539 --> 00:03:10.335
Whew! Those upper body workouts
really paid off. [chuckles]
之前的上身体能训练果然没白费

00:03:10.419 --> 00:03:12.421
Come on! We need to find Buck.
快 我们得找到巴克

00:03:12.504 --> 00:03:14.256
He's their only hope down here.
他是他们唯一的希望

00:03:14.339 --> 00:03:15.757
[Manny] Oh, great.
好极了 他们的小命就押在一只
会和自己的手说话的黄鼠狼身上

00:03:15.841 --> 00:03:19.553
Their lives may depend on
an unstable weasel who talks to his hand.
好极了 他们的小命就押在一只
会和自己的手说话的黄鼠狼身上

00:03:20.721 --> 00:03:21.972
[sighs]

00:03:22.055 --> 00:03:25.225
[rumbling]

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.895
[screams]

00:03:28.979 --> 00:03:30.272
Sid!
希德

00:03:30.355 --> 00:03:33.108
-[Diego shouts]
-[screaming]

00:03:33.191 --> 00:03:34.359
Run!
快跑

00:03:35.861 --> 00:03:37.946
[shouting]

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:40.824
[all screaming]

00:03:40.908 --> 00:03:41.909
[Manny] Whoa!

00:03:41.992 --> 00:03:43.452
-[Diego] Ha!
-[Sid] Oh!

00:03:43.535 --> 00:03:46.330
[all groaning]

00:03:46.413 --> 00:03:47.664
[Sid] Ow…

00:03:47.748 --> 00:03:50.125
-[growling]
-Huh?

00:03:50.209 --> 00:03:51.210
[groans]

00:03:54.838 --> 00:03:56.632
-[thuds]
-[growls]

00:03:56.715 --> 00:03:58.050
Mama!
妈妈

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:00.052
[growls]

00:04:00.135 --> 00:04:01.428
What's that, you say?
你说什么？

00:04:01.511 --> 00:04:02.971
[roars]

00:04:03.055 --> 00:04:04.514
The watering hole?
饮水坑？

00:04:04.598 --> 00:04:06.141
[growls]

00:04:06.683 --> 00:04:09.728
Oh, no! Crash and Eddie are in trouble.
不好 克拉什和埃迪遇到麻烦了

00:04:09.811 --> 00:04:11.897
You say that like it's news.
好像这是什么新鲜事似的

00:04:12.397 --> 00:04:14.399
[snarling]

00:04:18.153 --> 00:04:19.196
[groans]

00:04:20.447 --> 00:04:22.157
This is farewell, Buck.
该道别了 巴克

00:04:22.241 --> 00:04:26.703
Time to turn you into a chew toy
for my ravenous friends here.
是时候把你变成
我饥肠辘辘的朋友们的磨牙玩具了

00:04:27.496 --> 00:04:29.206
You'll never get away with this.
你肯定不会得逞的

00:04:29.289 --> 00:04:31.583
There's no way I'm letting
my pumpkin daughter
我绝不会让我的南瓜女儿

00:04:31.667 --> 00:04:33.001
grow up without a father.
失去父亲 孤单长大

00:04:33.585 --> 00:04:35.128
What? Okay, I'm done.
什么？我受够了

00:04:35.212 --> 00:04:40.008
Dinner is served,
compliments of King Orson.
开饭啦 托奥森大王的福

00:04:40.092 --> 00:04:41.552
Ooh, I like the sound of that.
听上去真顺耳

00:04:45.681 --> 00:04:47.558
[snarling]

00:04:49.309 --> 00:04:50.310
[gasps]

00:04:52.062 --> 00:04:53.063
[spitting]

00:04:53.146 --> 00:04:54.940
[thudding]

00:04:55.023 --> 00:04:56.942
-[Crash] Whoo-hoo!
-[Eddie] Yeah!

00:04:57.025 --> 00:04:59.236
Huh? [groaning]

00:04:59.319 --> 00:05:01.238
Ooh! Morons!
一群蠢才！

00:05:01.321 --> 00:05:03.490
[laughs] Good work, fellas!
好样的 伙计们

00:05:03.574 --> 00:05:04.950
Get skunked!
熏死他们

00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:06.201
Yeah!

00:05:07.077 --> 00:05:08.203
Hi-yah!

00:05:12.749 --> 00:05:14.960
[gas bubbles popping]

00:05:16.003 --> 00:05:19.464
I love the smell of skunky gas
in the morning.
我最喜欢早上闻到臭鼬的屁屁了

00:05:19.548 --> 00:05:21.508
-[laughs]
-Whoo!

00:05:22.301 --> 00:05:23.427
[growls]

00:05:27.931 --> 00:05:30.726
Bye-bye, Bucky. [laughs]
拜拜 巴克小子

00:05:30.809 --> 00:05:33.061
[screams]

00:05:33.145 --> 00:05:35.397
[groaning]

00:05:40.277 --> 00:05:42.571
Yeah!

00:05:48.076 --> 00:05:52.581
[Sid] Hang on, Crash and Eddie.
Here comes the T. rex express! [laughs]
克拉什 埃迪 坚持住！霸王龙特快来啦

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.463
[Zee] Buck!
巴克

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.298
Hey-ya!

